  "title": "United Bank Receives National Recognition as a Best Company to Work for and Best-in-State Bank for 2025",
  "summary": "CHARLESTON, SC – United Bank has recently received several national awards for employee engagement and customer satisfaction from U.S. News & World Report, Newsweek, and Forbes. These awards include Best Companies to Work for in the South, America’s Greatest Workplaces in Financial Services, America’s Greatest Workplaces by State, and Best-in-State Bank, respectively.",
